      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "National Dairy Research Institute (NDRI) was shifted to Karnal in 1955.",
        "Central Institute for Research on Buffaloes (CIRB) is located at Hisar.",
        "Gurugram is widely tested as the 'Millennium City' and the auto hub of India (Maruti Suzuki plant).",
        "Panipat is recognized as the 'City of Weavers' due to its massive textile industry."
